WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.096 --> 01:44.040
=Episode 7=

01:44.690 --> 01:45.576
By the way, Mr. Gao.

01:49.011 --> 01:49.690
No need to count.

01:50.770 --> 01:51.592
Not a penny less.

02:12.971 --> 02:13.690
(Oh, no!)

02:13.890 --> 02:14.850
(How did he hear)

02:14.850 --> 02:15.811
(I offended his dad?)

02:16.170 --> 02:17.610
(It's forcing a misunderstanding.)

02:20.130 --> 02:21.051
(I can't believe this.)

02:22.091 --> 02:22.811
Mr. Gao.

02:22.811 --> 02:23.610
Wait a moment.

02:24.651 --> 02:25.288
Okay.

02:32.610 --> 02:33.730
You heard everything.

02:36.010 --> 02:37.850
What kind of woman is she, exactly?

02:41.170 --> 02:43.610
She's just a vain woman.

02:44.211 --> 02:45.450
What she wants

02:45.931 --> 02:48.211
is much more than you imagine.

02:49.051 --> 02:49.890
I don't understand.

02:49.890 --> 02:51.730
Why would you like such a woman?

02:54.771 --> 02:55.331
Mr. Chairman,

02:56.130 --> 02:58.211
she's just a woman
you've met once or twice.

02:58.610 --> 03:00.771
Yet she knew you only
solve problems with money.

03:01.130 --> 03:02.130
Isn't it obvious enough?

03:04.771 --> 03:05.651
In this world,

03:05.651 --> 03:07.811
95% of the problems

03:07.811 --> 03:09.371
can be solved with money.

03:09.771 --> 03:11.130
Only the remaining 5%

03:11.771 --> 03:12.690
are unsolvable.

03:15.290 --> 03:15.931
I have to go.

03:28.651 --> 03:30.971
How much of that conversation
did you hear just now?

03:32.850 --> 03:33.531
I heard it all.

03:33.931 --> 03:34.931
All... Just now...

03:34.931 --> 03:35.651
About today,

03:36.010 --> 03:37.290
I hope you don't mind.

03:39.811 --> 03:41.170
I was worried you might mind.

03:42.811 --> 03:45.410
I just can't agree with some

03:45.410 --> 03:46.491
of your father's actions,

03:46.491 --> 03:48.570
so I couldn't help saying a bit more.

03:50.730 --> 03:52.450
When Letao ran into trouble back then,

03:53.170 --> 03:54.690
it was my mother's dowry

03:55.010 --> 03:55.971
that saved the business.

03:56.730 --> 03:57.416
Of course.

03:57.771 --> 03:59.730
My mother's family
also needed Letao's help.

04:00.371 --> 04:01.570
The marriage brought Letao

04:01.890 --> 04:03.170
to where it is today.

04:04.850 --> 04:06.331
So in my father's mind,

04:06.811 --> 04:07.850
a strong alliance

04:08.570 --> 04:10.091
is what sustains a family

04:10.091 --> 04:11.450
and keeps it prosperous.

04:13.850 --> 04:15.850
If he's thinking like a businessman,

04:16.531 --> 04:17.451
a marriage alliance

04:17.451 --> 04:18.451
for mutual gain,

04:18.810 --> 04:19.571
I can understand.

04:21.131 --> 04:22.370
But what do you think?

04:25.091 --> 04:26.011
What do you think?

04:26.571 --> 04:30.170
I don't think you would
sacrifice your marriage to trade

04:30.370 --> 04:31.571
for the company's development.

04:36.810 --> 04:39.131
Your view of love and marriage

04:39.651 --> 04:40.891
is still a fantasy.

04:43.091 --> 04:43.771
More or less.

04:44.730 --> 04:46.331
By the way, some of what I said today

04:46.571 --> 04:49.211
was on the spot.

04:49.410 --> 04:50.290
- You...
- It's okay.

04:51.211 --> 04:51.930
Still, thank you.

04:53.250 --> 04:53.891
Let's go.

04:53.891 --> 04:54.531
Where to?

04:55.810 --> 04:56.571
I'll take you home.

05:12.850 --> 05:14.571
Congratulations! So far,

05:14.571 --> 05:16.691
Male Lead's fondness
toward you is soaring.

05:16.771 --> 05:18.451
It's currently 38%.

05:21.651 --> 05:23.011
38%?

05:25.416 --> 05:26.984
(Currently 38%)

05:28.850 --> 05:30.290
That's a qualitative leap.

05:40.712 --> 05:42.280
(Business Hall)

05:45.410 --> 05:47.050
(If he's thinking like a businessman,)

05:47.891 --> 05:48.810
a marriage alliance

05:48.810 --> 05:49.730
for mutual gain,

05:49.730 --> 05:50.571
I can understand.

05:51.810 --> 05:55.451
I don't think you would
sacrifice your marriage to trade

05:55.610 --> 05:56.810
for the company's development.

06:09.850 --> 06:10.771
You're back, Huan'er.

06:11.571 --> 06:12.131
Look.

06:13.011 --> 06:14.011
Sauerkraut Fish.

06:14.410 --> 06:15.211
Dad's special.

06:15.691 --> 06:16.370
Smells good.

06:17.451 --> 06:18.410
Oh, there's one more.

06:18.410 --> 06:19.170
It's okay. No need.

06:19.170 --> 06:19.810
Don't make it.

06:20.050 --> 06:20.971
I must make it.

06:20.971 --> 06:23.011
Your favorite Sweet and Sour Ribs.

06:23.370 --> 06:23.971
- Almost done.
- It's okay.

06:23.971 --> 06:24.810
Really no need.

06:24.810 --> 06:25.730
I can't finish it.

06:25.930 --> 06:27.651
Huan'er, just let Dad make it.

06:27.651 --> 06:28.850
How long have you been away?

06:35.250 --> 06:35.810
How long?

06:36.451 --> 06:37.170
You've forgotten?

06:38.771 --> 06:40.331
Are you're still angry with Dad?

06:47.610 --> 06:48.331
Why?

07:02.011 --> 07:02.610
Dad.

07:03.810 --> 07:05.571
What are you doing? Go to sleep.

07:06.651 --> 07:08.091
Lately, Xiaojue is short on money.

07:08.531 --> 07:09.490
I have to go to work.

07:09.850 --> 07:11.610
Don't bring up Xiaojue to me anymore.

07:12.250 --> 07:14.131
For him, you worked
from dawn to dusk every day.

07:14.211 --> 07:15.170
You didn't even sleep.

07:15.211 --> 07:16.451
Your body will collapse!

07:16.651 --> 07:17.451
It's fine, Dad.

07:17.730 --> 07:19.131
I-I'll be fine in a few days.

07:19.290 --> 07:20.011
Will you listen?

07:20.211 --> 07:21.370
Will you listen? I...

07:28.691 --> 07:29.531
(Let me tell you.)

07:29.531 --> 07:31.011
Back then, for that Ou Xiaojue,

07:31.011 --> 07:32.211
you worked three jobs a day.

07:32.610 --> 07:33.810
You were exhausted.

07:34.930 --> 07:36.451
Dad was so angry at the time,

07:36.571 --> 07:37.810
so he slapped you.

07:44.730 --> 07:45.331
Huan'er, here.

07:47.091 --> 07:48.050
Huan'er, listen.

07:48.290 --> 07:49.571
Later, Dad regretted it so much.

07:50.850 --> 07:52.170
He just cared about his pride,

07:52.930 --> 07:53.891
so he never apologized.

07:54.571 --> 07:55.651
He did the right thing.

07:56.651 --> 07:58.370
But it wasn't hard enough, was it?

07:58.971 --> 08:00.290
He should've hit both sides.

08:00.290 --> 08:00.971
This, that.

08:01.610 --> 08:02.312
Huan'er, you...

08:04.930 --> 08:06.131
Here you are, my girls.

08:06.131 --> 08:06.971
- Let's eat.
- Come on.

08:09.091 --> 08:09.736
Come.

08:09.850 --> 08:10.930
It's okay, Dad, I'll do it.

08:11.290 --> 08:12.930
I don't have to work so many jobs now.

08:13.170 --> 08:13.771
Let me help.

08:16.050 --> 08:16.971
There's also soup.

08:22.490 --> 08:23.211
Nice.

08:23.490 --> 08:25.011
Tomato and Egg Soup.

08:25.331 --> 08:25.850
Put it here.

08:26.250 --> 08:27.691
- Here, come on.
- Sit now.

08:28.011 --> 08:28.691
Put it here.

08:31.850 --> 08:33.451
This is both of your favorites.

08:33.451 --> 08:34.411
Here, try some.

08:38.250 --> 08:40.130
All your things are still the same.

08:40.691 --> 08:41.850
No one dared to touch them.

08:42.451 --> 08:43.291
That's not true!

08:43.411 --> 08:45.211
You threw away
all of Ou Xiaojue's stuff.

08:46.171 --> 08:48.091
Didn't I go looking for it afterward?

08:48.291 --> 08:50.250
The garbage collectors
had already taken it away.

08:50.650 --> 08:51.691
I can vouch for that.

08:51.850 --> 08:53.250
You even searched the trash bins.

08:53.250 --> 08:54.691
Came back covered in dirt.

08:55.530 --> 08:57.250
Useless things should be thrown away.

08:57.250 --> 08:58.171
Why look for it?

09:02.051 --> 09:02.650
What's wrong?

09:04.171 --> 09:04.850
It's fine.

09:15.850 --> 09:18.250
I don't know why those people

09:18.451 --> 09:19.571
came to our house today.

09:20.650 --> 09:22.291
But you're definitely in trouble.

09:22.931 --> 09:24.091
(Property Deed)
This is our property deed.

09:24.370 --> 09:26.770
If push comes to shove, mortgage it.

09:27.331 --> 09:28.890
Pay them back first.

09:32.331 --> 09:33.490
What are you talking about?

09:33.971 --> 09:35.770
Dad's worried
you can't repay loan sharks.

09:36.451 --> 09:37.610
Huan'er, just take it.

09:37.610 --> 09:39.130
I've gotten used to living here.

09:39.250 --> 09:40.530
It's time for a change.

09:41.370 --> 09:43.730
I-I didn't borrow from loan sharks.

09:44.250 --> 09:46.650
I just...

09:48.171 --> 09:50.291
It's hard to explain in a few words.

09:53.010 --> 09:53.650
It's alright.

09:54.171 --> 09:54.811
Today,

09:54.811 --> 09:56.610
I want to make things clear to you.

09:57.571 --> 09:59.130
The old Lin Huan'er

09:59.490 --> 10:00.171
is dead.

10:01.211 --> 10:02.691
Don't say "dead"! It's bad luck.

10:02.931 --> 10:03.490
Okay, fine.

10:03.490 --> 10:04.211
Not dead.

10:04.211 --> 10:05.571
It's just a figure of speech.

10:05.571 --> 10:07.610
I'm brand-new now.

10:08.490 --> 10:09.091
Okay?

10:10.250 --> 10:12.890
From now on, I'll love myself more.

10:13.451 --> 10:14.571
I won't spend

10:14.571 --> 10:16.451
another cent

10:16.451 --> 10:17.171
on men,

10:17.411 --> 10:19.010
especially that Ou... Whatever.

10:23.490 --> 10:25.811
Huan'er, hearing you say that

10:26.091 --> 10:27.010
makes me so happy.

10:27.291 --> 10:28.331
You finally came around.

10:28.811 --> 10:29.850
- Enough.
- Should've happened sooner.

10:30.571 --> 10:31.571
Go to bed early.

10:31.650 --> 10:33.331
Dad, take the deed back.

10:35.490 --> 10:36.890
You keep it. Be good.

10:37.130 --> 10:38.130
You keep it.

10:41.051 --> 10:41.890
Listen to me.

10:45.000 --> 10:45.832
(Property Deed)

10:49.130 --> 10:50.091
Go to bed now.

10:50.811 --> 10:51.691
Go to bed now, Dad.

10:54.490 --> 10:55.091
Time to sleep.

11:00.610 --> 11:01.130
Huan'er,

11:02.010 --> 11:02.811
you're not yourself.

11:04.610 --> 11:05.411
How so?

11:06.250 --> 11:07.610
You are Lin Huan'er?

11:08.451 --> 11:10.370
Of course. Who else would I look like?

11:11.130 --> 11:11.770
Time to sleep.

11:20.730 --> 11:22.530
Huan'er, can I squeeze in with you?

11:23.130 --> 11:23.650
Okay.

11:24.650 --> 11:26.211
Huan'er, this time you came back,

11:26.211 --> 11:27.811
I feel you've completely changed.

11:29.811 --> 11:33.291
Maybe it's because people keep growing.

11:36.130 --> 11:38.370
Will you come back again in the future?

11:40.571 --> 11:42.010
Do you want me to come back often?

11:42.291 --> 11:42.931
Of course!

11:45.610 --> 11:46.250
I promise you.

11:46.691 --> 11:48.250
I'll visit often and stay with you.

11:49.530 --> 11:50.091
Okay.

11:51.411 --> 11:51.931
Just sleep.

11:57.010 --> 11:57.650
Not cold, right?

12:03.490 --> 12:04.130
Hold on.

12:05.490 --> 12:06.811
What's my birthday?

12:10.760 --> 12:11.848
I'll turn off the light.

12:24.931 --> 12:25.451
Mom.

12:27.370 --> 12:28.051
Wait.

12:29.811 --> 12:31.171
You're not going anywhere today.

12:32.040 --> 12:34.130
Mr. Xie and his family
will be here soon.

12:36.130 --> 12:37.650
I've got commitments, Mr. Chairman.

12:38.250 --> 12:40.691
Cancel all your commitments.

12:58.370 --> 12:58.890
Chairman Gao.

12:58.971 --> 12:59.490
They're here.

12:59.490 --> 13:00.331
Mr. Xie has arrived.

13:00.370 --> 13:00.971
Gao.

13:01.370 --> 13:01.971
Welcome, Xie.

13:01.971 --> 13:02.530
Mr. Xie.

13:03.370 --> 13:04.211
Mr. Xie, welcome.

13:04.451 --> 13:05.250
- Hello.
- Mr. Gao.

13:05.250 --> 13:06.010
Xie,

13:06.010 --> 13:07.931
your daughter gets more beautiful.

13:08.530 --> 13:09.091
Mrs. Gao.

13:10.370 --> 13:11.250
Come, have a seat.

13:11.250 --> 13:11.850
Haiming.

13:11.850 --> 13:12.490
Come on.

13:15.770 --> 13:16.890
I got you a gift.

13:18.291 --> 13:19.571
See if you like it.

13:23.931 --> 13:24.770
About that day,

13:24.931 --> 13:26.291
I know you didn't mean it.

13:29.451 --> 13:31.291
What is it? Let me see too.

13:32.250 --> 13:32.850
Mrs. Gao,

13:33.451 --> 13:35.010
it's a watch I picked for Haiming.

13:36.171 --> 13:38.411
Wanjun, you're so thoughtful.

13:39.370 --> 13:40.250
Thank you, Wanjun.

13:40.811 --> 13:41.610
You're welcome.

13:42.171 --> 13:42.691
Alright.

13:43.571 --> 13:44.931
Wait here for a moment.

13:45.370 --> 13:47.931
I want Haiming to help me pick a gown.

13:48.051 --> 13:48.811
Be right back.

13:49.130 --> 13:49.650
Okay.

13:50.610 --> 13:52.250
Mr. Xie, please sit.

13:52.451 --> 13:53.451
Okay, go ahead.

13:53.850 --> 13:54.490
Excuse me.

13:58.530 --> 13:59.211
Come, Wanjun.

13:59.770 --> 14:01.130
Sit.

14:01.331 --> 14:01.931
Okay.

14:13.490 --> 14:14.250
Haiming.

14:15.811 --> 14:16.490
Here's the thing.

14:17.811 --> 14:20.691
If you feel uncomfortable
or out of place,

14:22.010 --> 14:23.051
listen to my advice.

14:24.250 --> 14:27.130
Don't force yourself
to endure anything for anyone's sake.

14:28.451 --> 14:29.811
You can leave anytime.

14:33.928 --> 14:41.770
(To Lin Huan'er)

14:41.770 --> 14:43.411
Huan'er, something for you at reception.

14:43.411 --> 14:45.051
It's from a phone store.

14:45.211 --> 14:45.931
A gift for you.

14:46.451 --> 14:47.530
For me?

14:47.811 --> 14:49.010
(To Lin Huan'er)
It has your name on it.

14:53.331 --> 14:54.130
How cute!

14:54.890 --> 14:56.010
Something's up!

14:56.571 --> 14:57.451
Who sent it?

14:57.610 --> 14:58.971
Do I look like I know?

15:00.010 --> 15:00.691
Fair point.

15:04.171 --> 15:05.091
It's really beautiful.

15:08.168 --> 15:08.931
(Saved Contact: M12363552036)

15:08.931 --> 15:11.451
M? M...

15:13.010 --> 15:13.850
Mengmeng?

15:15.530 --> 15:16.770
Oh, my Mengmeng!

15:16.770 --> 15:18.890
Knowing I need a phone,
she sent me one. So sweet.

15:18.890 --> 15:19.811
Such a cute one!

15:20.770 --> 15:22.650
She even saved her contact in it.

15:23.051 --> 15:26.130
Xie, I know you're busy with work,

15:26.130 --> 15:27.250
always tied up.

15:27.650 --> 15:30.091
Remember those fine wines
I saved for you?

15:30.091 --> 15:31.730
You've never had time to try them.

15:32.451 --> 15:34.610
Today's gathering is perfect for it.

15:34.890 --> 15:36.770
Yeah, you've mentioned it several times.

15:37.571 --> 15:38.770
Let's finish them off today!

15:40.010 --> 15:40.650
Mr. Gao.

15:41.250 --> 15:42.730
Sorry to interrupt.

15:43.171 --> 15:44.971
I need to give Haiming his phone.

15:45.811 --> 15:47.211
Okay, go ahead.

15:47.211 --> 15:48.091
He's upstairs.

15:48.730 --> 15:49.250
Okay.

15:53.010 --> 15:53.890
I think they two

15:54.931 --> 15:56.091
make a good match.

15:58.984 --> 16:00.680
(Incoming Call: Lin Huan'er)

16:03.451 --> 16:04.051
Hello?

16:04.411 --> 16:06.211
Hello, Mengmeng. I got the phone.

16:06.211 --> 16:07.530
It's so cute. I love it so much!

16:07.530 --> 16:08.370
Thank you so much!

16:08.691 --> 16:11.211
Lin Huan'er,
why do I see you everywhere?

16:11.811 --> 16:12.811
Who are you?

16:13.250 --> 16:14.211
Who gave you that phone?

16:14.811 --> 16:16.091
Haiming gave you a phone?

16:16.490 --> 16:17.890
Did Haiming give me the phone?

16:18.291 --> 16:20.370
Who do you think you are
to get a phone from Haiming?

16:20.610 --> 16:22.530
How can you answer Haiming's phone?

16:22.890 --> 16:24.691
That's a violation of privacy, you know?

16:27.451 --> 16:28.811
He's my fiancé.

16:29.051 --> 16:30.890
Of course, I can answer his phone.

16:31.691 --> 16:33.211
Right now,

16:33.571 --> 16:36.530
our parents are finalizing
engagement plans.

16:36.890 --> 16:38.250
Haiming couldn't get away.

16:38.411 --> 16:39.610
So I answered for him.

16:41.250 --> 16:42.130
Engagement?

16:46.811 --> 16:47.610
Yes.

16:48.250 --> 16:50.051
I told you long ago

16:50.610 --> 16:52.211
that Haiming and I

16:52.370 --> 16:54.691
are destined for each other.

16:57.691 --> 16:58.530
Zhen, I'm leaving.

16:58.610 --> 16:59.130
Where to?

16:59.171 --> 17:00.370
To reclaim my main quest.

17:04.090 --> 17:04.611
Okay.

17:06.010 --> 17:07.330
Haiming is exceptional.

17:08.530 --> 17:10.330
He's the son-in-law I envision.

17:11.891 --> 17:13.010
Once you're engaged,

17:14.211 --> 17:16.171
don't dwell on that girl.

17:18.290 --> 17:20.250
Focus your attention on Haiming.

17:20.730 --> 17:21.490
I'll handle

17:22.171 --> 17:23.451
everything else for you,

17:24.931 --> 17:25.611
okay?

17:32.250 --> 17:35.290
It's been too long
since I saw Xie last time.

17:35.651 --> 17:37.611
Today, Xie and his daughter

17:37.611 --> 17:38.851
are visiting our home.

17:39.490 --> 17:40.530
For us,

17:40.530 --> 17:42.971
I think they are truly honored guests.

17:44.611 --> 17:46.851
His visit is a rare occasion.

17:47.931 --> 17:49.931
Haiming, chat more with Mr. Xie

17:49.931 --> 17:51.611
and Wanjun.

17:52.250 --> 17:54.211
You're always like a log.

17:54.611 --> 17:55.691
What are you doing?

17:56.330 --> 17:58.810
Haiming is exceptional.

17:59.530 --> 18:00.050
He's good.

18:02.050 --> 18:02.891
Master Haiming seems

18:02.891 --> 18:04.451
to have zero interest in Miss Xie.

18:05.211 --> 18:06.570
What the master is thinking?

18:06.691 --> 18:07.570
His intentions

18:07.891 --> 18:08.971
are beyond our guesswork.

18:18.611 --> 18:19.371
Haiming,

18:20.010 --> 18:21.090
your phone rang earlier.

18:21.810 --> 18:22.536
Thanks.

18:27.851 --> 18:28.411
Mr. Chairman,

18:28.651 --> 18:29.971
I have matters to attend to.

18:30.570 --> 18:31.530
Sorry, you go ahead.

18:31.691 --> 18:32.211
Excuse me.

18:43.171 --> 18:44.250
Let's begin without him.

18:44.691 --> 18:45.250
Please.

18:56.730 --> 18:57.411
Gao Haiming?

19:00.810 --> 19:01.451
Gao Haiming?

19:06.451 --> 19:07.050
Gao Haiming?

19:21.010 --> 19:21.691
Why are you here?

19:28.290 --> 19:29.490
Aren't these my shoes?

19:33.330 --> 19:35.090
I asked why you're at my house.

19:37.570 --> 19:39.050
As I heard about your engagement.

19:40.691 --> 19:41.411
Just for this?

19:42.451 --> 19:44.530
I'm here to rescue you from this mess.

19:45.490 --> 19:46.891
How do you know it's a mess?

19:47.570 --> 19:48.371
Because I think

19:48.371 --> 19:49.810
you wouldn't marry for business.

19:56.730 --> 19:57.451
You care deeply?

20:00.931 --> 20:01.971
Why give me a phone?

20:02.611 --> 20:03.411
For convenience.

20:03.411 --> 20:04.530
We have business dealings.

20:05.770 --> 20:06.611
That's all?

20:08.211 --> 20:09.451
Answer my question first.

20:09.770 --> 20:11.851
Why rush here when you heard

20:11.851 --> 20:12.931
about my engagement?

20:19.651 --> 20:21.411
Because I don't want you
engaged to others.

20:24.050 --> 20:26.651
Whether it's arranged dates,
a relationship, or marriage,

20:27.490 --> 20:28.411
I want you to know

20:28.411 --> 20:29.611
it won't be real love for you.

20:34.611 --> 20:35.570
Haiming.

20:37.451 --> 20:38.290
Haiming.

20:41.171 --> 20:42.050
Haiming.

20:43.971 --> 20:45.490
Want her gone for good?

20:46.730 --> 20:47.730
Haiming.

20:54.171 --> 20:54.770
Don't move.

20:56.371 --> 20:57.250
Haiming.

20:57.490 --> 20:58.490
Are you in there?

20:59.611 --> 21:00.971
I need to talk to you.

21:05.224 --> 21:08.392
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

21:11.368 --> 21:14.632
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

21:17.448 --> 21:21.032
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

21:25.931 --> 21:27.611
I'm coming in.

21:36.211 --> 21:37.250
Haiming,

21:38.090 --> 21:39.090
what are you doing?

21:40.570 --> 21:41.290
Lin Huan'er?

21:41.451 --> 21:42.131
Miss Xie,

21:45.090 --> 21:47.171
this is why I can't
get engaged with you.

21:47.490 --> 21:48.211
Please leave.

21:56.250 --> 21:57.250
Just you wait!

22:04.851 --> 22:06.851
T-That solved it permanently.

22:07.290 --> 22:08.090
You should go too.

22:12.730 --> 22:14.171
Can I take these shoes?

22:24.810 --> 22:25.570
Gao Haiming.

22:28.250 --> 22:29.490
What exactly do you mean?

22:31.250 --> 22:33.211
Do you realize
that with your outburst today,

22:33.611 --> 22:35.611
our cooperation with Fuchuang Company

22:35.611 --> 22:37.371
has become completely impossible?

22:37.611 --> 22:38.810
Has that Lin Huan'er

22:38.810 --> 22:39.851
bewitched you?

22:40.770 --> 22:41.971
If you insist on this,

22:42.211 --> 22:43.691
tomorrow I'll have the company

22:43.810 --> 22:45.451
terminate the partnership with Yunsheng.

22:45.851 --> 22:47.570
You're forbidden to see her from now on.

22:48.891 --> 22:49.530
Mr. Chairman,

22:50.211 --> 22:52.050
this has nothing to do with anyone else.

22:52.611 --> 22:53.611
No matter what you do,

22:53.851 --> 22:55.570
I will not marry Xie Wanjun.

23:00.171 --> 23:02.250
Are you determined to destroy Letao?

23:03.611 --> 23:04.330
Do you know

23:04.330 --> 23:06.250
what kind of situation
Letao is in right now?

23:06.250 --> 23:07.050
Do you know that?

23:07.490 --> 23:08.371
I'm fully aware.

23:08.810 --> 23:10.290
That's why I seek transformation.

23:11.090 --> 23:12.090
Just give me some time.

23:12.090 --> 23:13.891
I will surely solve
Letao's current crisis.

23:14.931 --> 23:16.171
Give you some time?

23:17.171 --> 23:18.330
What kind of time?

23:18.730 --> 23:19.851
You will surely?

23:20.851 --> 23:22.810
Just based on these flimsy words?

23:23.211 --> 23:24.971
Can you really guarantee the jobs

23:24.971 --> 23:27.530
of over 1,000 Letao employees?

23:30.971 --> 23:32.730
I gave Letao to you.

23:33.290 --> 23:35.651
Because you've never lost Letao.

23:35.770 --> 23:36.730
I did.

23:37.330 --> 23:39.171
I saved Letao and brought it back.

23:39.330 --> 23:40.891
So I know how difficult it is.

23:41.090 --> 23:41.891
Do you understand?

23:42.730 --> 23:43.730
A few words from you

23:43.730 --> 23:44.971
can solve the problem?

23:45.810 --> 23:46.851
Impossible!

23:47.250 --> 23:49.451
And that girl.

23:49.971 --> 23:51.730
You must cut ties with her.

23:53.490 --> 23:56.730
Otherwise, get out of this house!

23:58.330 --> 23:59.010
Mr. Chairman.

24:02.090 --> 24:03.411
Letao is your life's work.

24:04.050 --> 24:05.211
It's mine too.

24:07.131 --> 24:08.090
Since childhood,

24:08.971 --> 24:11.330
I've always acted according
to your demands and standards.

24:12.451 --> 24:13.451
But starting today,

24:14.530 --> 24:16.770
I will only act
according to my own will.

24:22.451 --> 24:23.290
Gao Haiming!

24:31.770 --> 24:32.490
Come on, Xie.

24:37.371 --> 24:38.530
Have a seat.

24:40.611 --> 24:42.730
No need to be polite. This is your turf.

24:43.290 --> 24:44.090
Just relax.

24:44.810 --> 24:47.010
Don't draw such a clear line between us.

24:47.971 --> 24:50.010
I can tell you're still furious.

24:50.851 --> 24:53.490
Look, we have been friends
for so many years.

24:53.931 --> 24:56.770
We shouldn't let the kids' issues
ruin our friendship,

24:56.770 --> 24:57.330
right?

24:57.851 --> 24:59.770
I don't deserve
to be called your friend.

25:00.290 --> 25:02.211
Haiming pulled such a stunt.

25:02.851 --> 25:04.770
What's that supposed to mean?

25:07.250 --> 25:07.770
Xie,

25:07.770 --> 25:10.330
it's true I failed
to discipline Haiming properly.

25:10.851 --> 25:12.250
But you know, he's young.

25:12.250 --> 25:13.530
He does foolish things.

25:13.530 --> 25:15.691
- For an adult...
- He's already hiding a lover.

25:16.250 --> 25:17.570
And you call it foolishness?

25:20.090 --> 25:21.810
We are all adults.

25:22.250 --> 25:25.611
We know what matters
and what doesn't in life and business.

25:26.330 --> 25:30.651
However, Wanjun and I
respect Haiming's choice.

25:33.250 --> 25:34.971
Xie, how about this?

25:35.691 --> 25:37.810
After Letao's new product launches,

25:37.810 --> 25:39.770
on top of the original contract terms,

25:40.211 --> 25:41.851
I'll concede an extra 3% to you.

25:42.931 --> 25:44.451
This is my way of showing sincerity,

25:44.810 --> 25:45.611
my apology.

25:47.090 --> 25:51.530
Gao, do you think I need those 3%?

25:52.250 --> 25:55.131
I know you certainly don't.

25:55.490 --> 25:57.090
Isn't this my way of showing sincerity?

25:57.691 --> 25:58.971
Rest assured. Regarding this,

25:58.971 --> 26:00.971
I will have Haiming
give Wanjun an explanation.

26:01.451 --> 26:02.570
Enough said.

26:03.611 --> 26:04.971
Though I value wealth,

26:06.411 --> 26:08.290
I only have this one daughter.

26:08.651 --> 26:10.570
Anyone who makes Wanjun unhappy

26:10.691 --> 26:12.490
is my enemy.

26:13.371 --> 26:15.250
We'll talk about cooperation
another time.

26:18.691 --> 26:19.611
Xie.

26:21.330 --> 26:22.090
Xie.

26:42.851 --> 26:43.931
I'm a taxi driver.

26:43.931 --> 26:44.530
I'm off duty.

26:44.530 --> 26:45.480
Let me give you a ride.

26:45.611 --> 26:46.570
Okay, thanks.

26:46.691 --> 26:48.010
I see you don't have shoes.

26:48.010 --> 26:49.611
I happen to have a pair here.

26:49.691 --> 26:50.490
Wear these for now.

26:50.490 --> 26:51.530
Thank you.

26:51.530 --> 26:52.168
You're welcome.

26:52.330 --> 26:53.371
Come on. Get in quick.

26:55.131 --> 26:55.891
Thank you.

27:10.152 --> 27:12.904
♪Entwined worries linger♪

27:14.050 --> 27:15.290
That's not right.

27:16.570 --> 27:17.891
It's already like this.

27:18.810 --> 27:21.411
How come the fondness
isn't increasing anymore?

27:26.696 --> 27:29.672
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

27:31.016 --> 27:34.536
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

27:35.400 --> 27:40.968
♪Until the world's end♪

27:42.611 --> 27:43.651
(So Mr. Gao,)

27:44.490 --> 27:46.651
you're only willing to be a catalyst
in my love life

27:47.290 --> 27:48.570
and don't want to be part of it?

27:51.171 --> 27:52.931
Because I don't want you
engaged to others.

27:53.411 --> 27:56.090
(Whether it's arranged dates,
a relationship, or marriage,)

27:57.050 --> 27:57.971
(I want you to know)

27:57.971 --> 27:59.272
(it won't be real love for you.)

27:59.816 --> 28:03.304
♪If I could♪

28:03.784 --> 28:07.400
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

28:08.008 --> 28:15.368
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

28:18.696 --> 28:19.240
(Recipient: Lin Huan'er)

28:19.240 --> 28:20.296
(Send Message)

28:20.296 --> 28:23.720
(Compose Message)

28:27.400 --> 28:30.152
(Compose Message)

28:45.131 --> 28:45.971
Hu Tiehan.

28:46.611 --> 28:47.250
Mengmeng?

28:51.290 --> 28:52.810
My car seems to have broken down.

28:53.050 --> 28:54.250
I'm going to a comic con now.

28:54.250 --> 28:55.290
Could you give me a ride?

28:55.411 --> 28:56.810
Park here. I'll handle it later.

28:56.971 --> 28:57.891
I'll get someone.

28:59.691 --> 29:00.330
No need.

29:01.451 --> 29:02.971
You should be off work soon, right?

29:03.891 --> 29:05.330
I'll wait nearby for you.

29:05.371 --> 29:06.050
Right away.

29:09.931 --> 29:10.530
Be careful.

29:11.371 --> 29:11.931
Hello, An?

29:12.651 --> 29:14.344
Help drive someone.
Chenghua Road. Urgent.

29:15.490 --> 29:16.971
Can't you just drive me?

29:17.211 --> 29:18.651
When was the last time I saw you?

29:19.530 --> 29:21.931
But I'm on duty now.

29:24.211 --> 29:25.730
I'll wait for you to finish your work.

29:26.211 --> 29:27.691
There's a new restaurant up ahead.

29:27.691 --> 29:28.651
Let's go eat together?

29:30.691 --> 29:32.931
Wait, aren't you in a hurry
for the comic con?

29:34.312 --> 29:37.211
Just a sec. My friend will be here soon.
He's at the next intersection.

29:37.211 --> 29:38.330
Just wait a bit in the car.

29:42.570 --> 29:43.691
I'll take a taxi myself.

29:48.971 --> 29:49.691
Mengmeng.

29:49.691 --> 29:50.530
Be careful, Mengmeng.

29:50.891 --> 29:52.651
Well... Stay safe.

29:52.770 --> 29:54.611
Don't worry, I'll take care of your car.

30:05.891 --> 30:06.536
Hello?

30:06.810 --> 30:07.530
Huan'er,

30:07.611 --> 30:09.851
that Silly Goose is driving me crazy!

30:10.330 --> 30:12.530
My car broke down
right where he was on duty.

30:12.530 --> 30:14.010
Even the car was smart enough.

30:14.330 --> 30:16.451
He was dense enough
to get someone else to drive me!

30:17.090 --> 30:18.010
Isn't it infuriating?

30:18.090 --> 30:19.171
Mengmeng,

30:19.931 --> 30:21.250
do you really have to fixate

30:21.250 --> 30:22.691
on Hu Tiehan?

30:23.691 --> 30:26.611
Don't give up the entire forest
for just one tree.

30:27.131 --> 30:28.010
The world is vast.

30:28.010 --> 30:29.171
Go out and explore!

30:29.971 --> 30:31.611
Then could you bear
to give up on Xiaojue?

30:33.371 --> 30:34.851
Anyone who wants him can have him.

30:35.730 --> 30:37.290
What is it? I want it too.

30:37.730 --> 30:38.730
I suggest you calm down.

30:38.891 --> 30:40.050
It's not anything good.

30:40.931 --> 30:41.691
That makes sense.

30:41.971 --> 30:42.651
Then I quit.

30:46.851 --> 30:48.050
There aren't many good things.

30:48.810 --> 30:49.611
Why hasn't

30:49.611 --> 30:51.250
Gao Haiming made any move?

30:52.770 --> 30:55.131
Got it. Looks like I have
to take the initiative again.

30:59.048 --> 30:59.592
(Letao Tower)

30:59.730 --> 31:02.490
Fuchuang has already secured contracts
with some of the agency brands

31:02.490 --> 31:04.010
before your company's renewal period.

31:05.010 --> 31:08.090
(Corporate Equity Acquisition Contract)
Some remaining brands have decided.

31:08.530 --> 31:11.651
And there are very few left
under negotiation.

31:14.211 --> 31:16.691
Miss Xie, please speak plainly.

31:17.530 --> 31:19.611
Letao and Fuchuang
have cooperated for many years.

31:20.371 --> 31:22.211
But as things stand now,

31:22.490 --> 31:24.691
a merger is inevitable.

31:25.570 --> 31:28.371
Fuchuang acquiring 60% of Letao's shares

31:28.770 --> 31:30.891
would actually be beneficial for Letao's

31:31.211 --> 31:32.250
long-term development.

31:33.171 --> 31:34.770
Mr. Gao, you should reconsider.

31:35.250 --> 31:36.651
After all, it is a major decision.

31:36.971 --> 31:38.570
It requires your careful consideration.

31:39.851 --> 31:42.371
But for Letao,

31:43.250 --> 31:45.131
there doesn't seem
to be a better choice.

31:49.691 --> 31:50.810
Then I won't bother you.

31:51.090 --> 31:52.171
Compared to me,

31:52.530 --> 31:55.451
you need more time to think.

32:01.691 --> 32:02.651
I'll await your call.

32:05.891 --> 32:06.490
Take care.

32:17.131 --> 32:18.371
Mr. Gao, it's confirmed.

32:18.730 --> 32:19.810
Mr. Du, the Chief Engineer
of the R&D department,

32:19.810 --> 32:21.570
and his team submitted
their resignations.

32:22.611 --> 32:24.371
Just when you negotiated with Miss Xie.

32:26.290 --> 32:27.090
It was my oversight.

32:27.400 --> 32:29.032
They must've made some moves
long before.

32:29.131 --> 32:30.290
They're cutting off options

32:30.290 --> 32:31.090
to force compliance.

32:31.770 --> 32:33.290
Other R&D staff will work as usual

32:33.770 --> 32:35.090
with a fivefold attendance bonus.

32:35.530 --> 32:36.490
Post job openings.

32:36.691 --> 32:37.611
Organize interviews.

32:38.131 --> 32:38.651
Besides,

32:39.010 --> 32:41.250
compile a list
of raw materials experts for me.

32:41.651 --> 32:42.312
Go.

32:56.330 --> 32:57.010
Really?

32:57.810 --> 32:59.250
Why are you surprised?

32:59.971 --> 33:02.171
On the surface, it's Xie Wanjun
from Fuchuang

33:02.171 --> 33:03.171
likes Gao Haiming.

33:03.490 --> 33:04.651
(Fuchuang - Miss Xie)
So they promoted a marriage alliance.

33:04.651 --> 33:05.371
(Miss Xie - Gao Haiming,
Letao - Gao Haiming)

33:05.371 --> 33:06.250
But actually,

33:06.530 --> 33:08.530
Fuchuang has long wanted
to acquire Letao.

33:09.330 --> 33:11.570
Now, Fuchuang should have snatched

33:11.570 --> 33:13.384
half of Letao's
product distribution rights.

33:13.730 --> 33:16.010
Isn't it clearly using Gao Haiming
as leverage

33:16.250 --> 33:18.171
to seize Letao's market share?

33:19.971 --> 33:21.490
A diversionary tactic.

33:21.800 --> 33:23.464
(Gao Haiming)

33:24.490 --> 33:25.891
Didn't see that coming, Mengmeng.

33:26.131 --> 33:28.050
You're clueless about relationships,

33:28.530 --> 33:29.651
but in business analysis,

33:29.651 --> 33:30.810
you're spot on.

33:32.611 --> 33:34.851
Growing up watching
these power struggles,

33:35.090 --> 33:36.490
I've seen through it long ago.

33:36.651 --> 33:37.651
I just didn't care.

33:40.971 --> 33:41.851
Now, it seems

33:41.851 --> 33:43.770
Gao Haiming might be in trouble.

33:47.528 --> 33:49.256
(Gao Haiming)

33:50.696 --> 33:52.131
So far, 16 of Letao's agency brands

33:52.131 --> 33:53.171
have reached agreements

33:53.171 --> 33:54.090
with us.

33:54.611 --> 33:56.931
Six more brands plan
to switch to Fuchuang

33:56.931 --> 33:58.371
after contract expiration.

33:58.810 --> 34:00.411
Only 17 brands remain undecided

34:00.411 --> 34:02.010
about cooperation with us.

34:03.931 --> 34:05.171
Alright, you may leave.

34:07.691 --> 34:08.610
I'd like to see

34:08.891 --> 34:10.490
how he turns this situation around.

34:11.451 --> 34:12.451
We just poached

34:13.010 --> 34:15.291
Letao's core R&D team.

34:16.010 --> 34:17.851
Yet their production line plans

34:18.130 --> 34:19.891
seem unaffected.

34:20.170 --> 34:21.210
So what?

34:21.771 --> 34:23.371
They couldn't even hold the market share

34:23.371 --> 34:24.530
for brand-name products.

34:24.851 --> 34:26.210
For a newly developed brand,

34:26.411 --> 34:27.931
can it really make an impact?

34:29.490 --> 34:30.610
Don't underestimate him.

34:32.010 --> 34:34.490
This Mr. Gao has some skills.

34:42.130 --> 34:42.771
Hello?

34:47.050 --> 34:47.771
I see.

34:49.451 --> 34:50.610
My guess was correct.

34:51.331 --> 34:53.130
They hired Dr. Liu's team

34:53.130 --> 34:54.731
for technical support.

34:57.010 --> 34:59.811
It seems he's still fighting.

35:00.731 --> 35:01.331
Be patient.

35:02.650 --> 35:04.291
Signed contracts can be broken.

35:05.170 --> 35:08.050
Let alone unfinished deals.

35:18.993 --> 35:21.976
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:23.185 --> 35:25.956
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:27.857 --> 35:33.770
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:35.567 --> 35:38.627
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:39.793 --> 35:43.245
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:44.241 --> 35:49.767
♪Until the world's end♪

35:52.177 --> 35:55.973
♪If I could♪

35:56.561 --> 35:59.377
♪Keep loving you♪

36:00.401 --> 36:02.801
♪Hearing two hearts♪

36:02.801 --> 36:07.717
♪Beating together♪

36:08.689 --> 36:12.553
♪If I could♪

36:12.553 --> 36:15.793
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

36:16.849 --> 36:24.174
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

36:25.233 --> 36:28.177
♪Entwined worries linger♪

36:29.425 --> 36:32.177
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

36:34.033 --> 36:39.813
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

36:41.745 --> 36:44.770
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

36:46.015 --> 36:49.681
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

36:50.449 --> 36:56.296
♪Until the world's end♪

36:58.289 --> 37:02.193
♪If I could♪

37:02.801 --> 37:05.553
♪Keep loving you♪

37:06.609 --> 37:08.945
♪Hearing two hearts♪

37:08.945 --> 37:13.905
♪Beating together♪

37:14.897 --> 37:18.460
♪If I could♪

37:18.460 --> 37:22.161
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

37:23.153 --> 37:30.385
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪
